{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はずっと気になってた雑貨屋の\nAquviiに行ってきた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"道に迷うのはわかってたから\nいろんな人に道を聞きながら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たどり着いたときの感動はもう...\nはー素敵だったな。\n春だしぽかぽかしてたし、\n気持ちよかったし、\n雑貨たちがかわいすぎるし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"代官山→渋谷→原宿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとりで歩き回るの楽しいな。\n足痛いがな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フラッシュモブがわからない\n自分にどういう意味か教えて下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不特定多数の人が公共の場で\n急にダンスなどパフォーマンスして\n即解散するものです！\n目的は何もないみたい。\nただ知らない人はびっくりするね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始まりはニューヨークだそうです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何系映画が好きですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特にこれというものはないです。\nいろんなジャンルを観て勉強したい。\nホラーは見れんけどな！！←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズム歌もPVもいいんだけど\n万理華見つけられないから\nよかったらどこに写ってるのか\n教えてくれないかな?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"教室のさゆりんの隣の席、\n教室掃除のシーンの雑巾掛けは\n私です！！！！\n実はもう一つシーン撮ったんだけど\n時間の都合でカット。\nまたチャンスがあればいいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のブログの写真の答えは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ><言ってなかった。\n正解はまあやです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"難しかった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男役の髪型にするまで\n何分かかったんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー30分くらいだったと思う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズムでは誰と\nカップルしてるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男装気に入ってる？？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりみなさん女子だと\n思ったでしょ。私も男装すること\n聞いたときはびっくりしたよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男らしくなりたいと思った！\n私服に戻りたくなかった笑\n立ち方とか座り方とか自分なりに\n男子をイメージしたよ。\nスタッフさん曰く私は個性的な\n男の子役らしい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はウィッグ被って\n本格的に男装したいな。\n個性的な弟系で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校があって握手会に行けないの\nですが、それでも許してくれますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に行く行けないから\nどうとか、全くないよ。\n応援してくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校がんばれ！！私もがんばる！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか'17は発売されるんですか?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"運営ブログ見たかしら！\nものづくりイベントレポ載ってるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャキイズムMVラストシーンの\nガラス越しの生駒の顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/06/7155260/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃすき！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}